[Music]  to the delight of many fans many new  details about the upcoming the  expandables 4 were announced at  cinemacon the movie will officially be  called the expendables with a 4 instead  of an a in the title and will be much  more violent than its predecessor  moreover we now know who exactly will be  involved in the blockbuster the  published cast list includes names like  jason statham dolph lunker and curtis  jackson aka 50 cent megan foxx andy  garcia and of course sylvester stallone  the plot is expected to focus on a  potential nuclear war between the united  states and russia which makes the topic  as relevant as ever we also learned from  a statement by stallone that this will  be the last expandables movie starring  him instead there will be more emphasis  on characters like statham's league  christmas in the future in addition to  the expandables which is scheduled to  hit theaters in the course of next year  a spin-off of jason statham's character  is also being planned along with a  female counterpart called the  expendables  fast and furious fans were in for a  surprise when director justin lin  announced his exit from fast and furious  10. allegedly there were various  conflicts between lin and the studio for  example he is said to have been faced  with a screenwriter with whom he did not  get along well then diesel who is a  producer besides his work as an actor is  also believed to have contributed  significantly to lin's departure on  april 23rd there's said to have been a  big dispute then diesel seems not to  have backed down on certain demands  regarding the film which was probably  too much for the director both sides  came to an agreement and decided to look  for a new director which is an extremely  costly affair each missed day of  shooting is set to cost the studio up to  1 million us dollars in expenses besides  it was necessary to find not only any  director but one who's willing to lower  his own creative standards after all the  requirements of diesel and universal  have to be met with frenchman louis  literally they may have found that  person in any case he has already  produced some good movies like the  transporter or now you see me we are  eager to find out how the production  will evolve under the new direction fast  and furious 10 is scheduled for release  on may 19 2023  there's news from the marvel cinematic  universe as disney revealed recently  there are changes in the release dates  of the marvels and ant-man and the wasp  quantum mania the marvels is pushed back  a few months and will no longer be  released in february but on july 28 2023  in exchange the new ant-man film will  take over the old release date of the  marvels and will now hit theaters  significantly earlier on february 17  2023 according to disney's official  announcement this has a very convenient  reasons as ant-man 3 is presently in a  much more advanced stage of production  than planned further information is  available on another mcu film namely  fantastic four the release date has not  been altered here but there has been a  change of director as deadline reporter  john watts has left the project because  he needs some distance from the  superhero genre for the time being this  is more than comprehensible after all  the 40 year old directed the entire  spiderman trilogy with tom holland his  former employer also shows sympathy in a  statement marvel boss kevin feige  expressly wishes to work with him again  in the future now watts is responsible  for a thriller on apple tv plus that  features a top class cast including  george clooney and brad pitt and that  fits perfectly with the desired  superhero break unfortunately it is not  yet known when exactly and above all  with which director fantastic four will  go into production  fans have been waiting for the next  installment of the mission impossible  franchise to be released since january  2019. now after many eventless months  during the pandemic new details are  finally coming to light the movie  previously known only as mission  impossible 7 now has a new title mission  impossible death reckoning part 1. hence  the upcoming eighth part will be mission  impossible dead reckoning part two a  first trailer was shown to selected  people at the recent cinemacon but it  has not yet been published online  according to eyewitness reports the  trailer shows a conversation between  ethan hunt and his ex-boss eugene  kitteridge who was last seen in the very  first mission impossible film there are  also exciting shots from the well-known  filming locations of venice the vatican  and the vast desert in addition to tom  cruise as ethan hunt and henry cherny as  kittridge the trailer also features  vanessa kirby as white widow and rebecca  ferguson as ilsa at the end of the  trailer tom cruise daring motorcycle  stunt over a cliff and norway can be  admired though there were no big  surprises the shown material looks very  promising for a traditional mission  impossible movie  many fans are looking forward to the  next installments of the john wick  franchise including the series the  continental and the spin-off ballerina  this news about the latter is shooting  is set to start already this summer the  plot of the spin-off revolves around a  young follower of the ballerinas this is  a group of female assassins who are  trained by the director incidentally  this is something they have in common  with john wick since he too was made  into the killer he is today by ruska  roma when he was an orphan like the  young john wick the young assassin  rooney brown also has the ambitious goal  of becoming a professional killer having  had her entire family murdered she now  seeks revenge she suspects elias mueller  the mayor of the unremarkable town of  sunnyvale to be behind the crime after  the filming with leading actress hannah  de armas failed to start as planned in  2020 due to the pandemic the shooting is  now scheduled to begin this summer  lion's gate should have enough to do at  the moment anyway since john wick  chapter 4 is currently in  post-production it looks like fans can  also expect an appearance by keanu  reeves as john wick in ballerina we  would be very surprised if lionsgate  missed the opportunity the director is  len weissman who was already in charge  of john wick chapter 3 parabellum  there's no release date for ballerina  yet but the next movie from the  franchise will be john wick chapter 4  anyways due for release on march 24th  2023  john krasinski's a quiet place was a  huge success among horror and thriller  fans in its 2018 release year the story  is explained quite simply earth has been  conquered by mysterious aliens who are  drawn to sounds thanks to their  sensitive hearing those who have not yet  fallen victim to the so-called death  angels must lead their lives in absolute  silence otherwise they will be slain by  the monsters a quiet place and its  sequels are about the abbott family  played by the actors emily blunt john  krasinski millicent simmons and noah  jupe after a quiet place 2 was already  released in theaters last summer rumors  about a third part started to pile up  krazynski did confirm that the story of  the abbots is not over yet but that we  will have to wait until at least 2025.  however a spinoff announced that  cinemacon is expected to be released  much sooner on the september 22nd 2023  the official title of the movie is a  quiet place day one which already gives  us a rough idea of the plot the spin-off  will certainly deal with the original  arrival of the aliens as its main  subject fittingly the movie is likely to  be much more chaotic than the main  series after all when the aliens arrived  the humans had no idea how to survive  the battle against them the extremely  costly learning process could then also  take place in a different setting for  example in a big city with many  potential victims behind the scenes  director michael sanofsky is to helm the  movie after jeff nichols left the  production to pursue a sci-fi project of  his own zarnovsky is still largely  unknown but has already had some success  with his film pig starring nicholas cage  we are definitely excited to see what  the young director will come up with in  a quiet place day one and are looking  forward to the movie which will hit  theaters on september 22nd 2023  that's it for our news today this week  we suggest you watch the new trailer for  the obi-wan kenobi series as well as the  new trailer for the game of thrones  prequel house of the dragon you don't  want to miss it  [Music]

